OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fclear and dry night for most with
OL,7,Fovernight temperatures dropping away
OL,8,Fand widespread overnight frost. In the
OL,9,Ffar north, showers feed through with
OL,10,Fsome snow over high ground. Winds
OL,11,Falong North Sea coasts ease.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FOn Friday, plenty of autumnal
OL,14,Fsunshine for England and Wales. It
OL,15,Fwill be cloudier in Northern Ireland,
OL,16,Fwhile showers move into northwest
OL,17,FScotland. Overnight, remaining cold
OL,18,Fwith widespread frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
